==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
A form of ''[[nokkur]]''

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverbs}}

# [[fairly]], [[quite]]
#: ''Þetta er '''nokkuð''' gott.''
#:: This is '''rather''' good.
#: ''Er þetta '''nokkuð''' slæmt?''
#:: This is bad, isn't it?
#: ''Ertu '''nokkuð''' með [[bók]]ina?''
#:: Do you '''by any chance''' have the [[book]]?